   },
   {
    "suite": "experience_fix",
    "ok": true,
    "answer": "先用 `utf-8-sig` 编码读取 CSV（例如 `pd.read_csv('file.csv', encoding='utf-8-sig')`），这样会自动去掉文件开头的 BOM，列名前的奇怪字符就消失了。",
    "prompt_tokens": 354,
    "completion_tokens": 162,
    "ms": 32141
